# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallbacks for the combined monorepo build.
# Real files (assets, index.html) are served first; these only catch client-side routes.
#
# The Sang app site (react-router / BrowserRouter) lives under /app. A wildcard
# `/app/*  /app/index.html  200` is REJECTED by Cloudflare as an infinite loop
# (the destination matches the source), so list each /app client route explicitly.
# Add a line here whenever the Sang site gains a new route.
/app/privacy   /app/index.html   200
#
# The CMS at / is hash-routed, so this standard root SPA fallback covers it.
/*             /index.html       200
